# ── Phase 5: Utah location architecture ──────────────────────────────────────
# Standalone Part D is approved for a whole state at a time, and Medigap
# benefits are federal with state-regulated pricing — neither varies by county
# (verified against CMS contract service-area data, July 2026). The county
# versions of those two topics therefore consolidated into the statewide pages.
# County Medicare Advantage and county hubs are UNCHANGED: MA availability
# genuinely does vary by county.
#
# EN → EN and ES → ES only, never across languages. The .html variants are
# defensive: Cloudflare's automatic .html → extensionless normalization only
# applies while the built file exists, so once these outputs are gone the .html
# form would 404. Each points straight at the final destination — no chains.

